Z||000007||88formula||01-08-2001||05:59 PM||||The Regal goes 0-60 mph in 6.8 seconds and runs the quarter mile in 15 seconds. A stock 5-speed fiero will go 0-60 mph in 8 seconds and run the quarter mile in 16 seconds. You may take him off the line though because the fiero launches off the line very well and front wheel drive cars just spin there tires. <P>Unless you have some serious modifications you’re going to lose in straight line acceleration. If you want to take him you’re going to have to do it on a road course with curves.<P>||||reg||1
